// title: Entra Risk Events & MITRE ATT&CK Analysis
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Entra
// tables: AADUserRiskEvents
// purpose: Entra Risk Events & MITRE ATT&CK Analysis
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Entra%20Risk%20Events%20&%20MITRE%20ATT&CK%20Analysis.kql
